{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id119760486"}, "name":{"label":"OtherClutter"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-06-03T11:33:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.8"}, "id":{"label":"11339667935"}, "title":{"label":"Elegant app"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded 4 of the App Store habit trackers all at once and plugged my daily stationary bike goal into each one. By day 3, this is the last one standing. I added a second habit of eating 5x fruits and vegetables in and I’m loving checking off each time to see the progress wheel light up that much more. I deleted the others and subscribed to this one. I love the elegance of it. It’s got like a retro vibe with the binary dots that fill up. And I gotta say that there were no ads, and the free version was absolutely useable. I mostly subscribed to be supportive because I know I’m going to use this a lot.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=6443918070&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
